<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RUGBY UNION-CURRIE CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-CURRIE CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Currie Cup rugby union results on Saturday:</p>
<p>Bloemfontein - Free State beat Western Province 25-16 (halftime 10-6).</p>
<p>Wellington - Boland beat Western Transvaal 16-11 (11-6).</p>
<p>Durban - Natal beat Eastern Province 53-9 (15-6).</p>
<p>Brakpan - Northern Transvaal beat Eastern Transvaal 72-24 (25-10).</p>
<p>Johannesburg - Transvaal beat South Eastern Transvaal 29-26 (13-21).</p>
<p>Welkom (played Friday) - Northern Free State beat South Western Districts 67-19 (19-12).</p>
</text>
